      <description><![CDATA[<p>Blit 1.0.1. Move To, Move to the other pane, Move to Suggested and F6 now move files to another drive: each file is removed from its old place once its copy is verified. Before, they copied the files there and left the originals. A move within one drive renames the files instead of copying them.</p>]]></description>
